JAN-FEB2024 @hanoihantrakul
These experiments were conducted in Jan/Feb 2024 when 
Hanoi and Yi were working together. They were meant
to explore the usage of perceptual pitch models as 
a loss signal for DualUMM training. We never actually
used these models and they should not be confused
with the folder called `convumm_pitch_loss_experiments`

I moved it into the archive folder to indicate you 
will likely not need to use this config.